flowchart TD
    accTitle: RFP Agent planned workflow
    accDescr: Prior proposals become cited evidence. RFP sources become requirements. A Vultr backend compares them and drafts a response with gaps flagged. Voice edits require approval. A human exports and submits.
    P["Prior proposals"] --> E["Cited evidence"]
    S["RFP sources"] --> F["RFP requirements"]
    subgraph V["Vultr backend · planned"]
      E --> C["Check fit + gaps"]
      F --> C
      C --> D["Draft response"]
      D --> R["Human review"]
      R --> Q["Propose edit + diff"]
      Q -->|Apply edit · save version| R
    end
    R -->|Approve export| X["Export draft"]
    X --> H["You submit"]
    classDef input fill:#f5f4ee,stroke:#a8b69e,color:#172b29
    classDef work fill:#e6ecdf,stroke:#8caa7c,color:#172b29
    classDef human fill:#176349,stroke:#176349,color:#ffffff
    classDef output fill:#fff6df,stroke:#c8ad6d,color:#172b29
    class P,S input
    class E,F,C,D,Q work
    class R,H human
    class X output
